WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.687
Did democracy weaken caste?

2
00:00:02.687 --> 00:00:04.210
Or did caste learn to

3
00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:05.691
use democracy?

4
00:00:06.043 --> 00:00:08.884
Rajni Kothari argued in 1970

5
00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:12.291
that politics politicises caste.

6
00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:14.071
Caste becomes a vehicle for

7
00:00:14.071 --> 00:00:16.223
organising and bargaining.

8
00:00:16.926 --> 00:00:19.953
The Mandal Commission reported in

9
00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:23.067
1980. Its OBC reservation was

10
00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:25.472
implemented in 1990.

11
00:00:25.472 --> 00:00:26.238
In 1992,

12
00:00:26.238 --> 00:00:28.137
Indra Sawhney upheld it,

13
00:00:28.137 --> 00:00:30.036
with a 50 percent ceiling

14
00:00:30.036 --> 00:00:32.001
and a creamy layer.

15
00:00:32.335 --> 00:00:34.379
The same topic covers religion

16
00:00:34.379 --> 00:00:35.909
and communalism,

17
00:00:35.909 --> 00:00:38.627
and regional and ethnic movements.

18
00:00:38.976 --> 00:00:40.247
Your turn.

19
00:00:40.247 --> 00:00:42.224
What ceiling did it set?
